  "description": "The Smok Novo 5 Pod Kit is a fantastic pod kit for vapers who are looking for a compact, beginner-friendly device that delivers excellent performance. With its sleek form-factor and wide variety of eye-catching patterns and styles, including a leather series, the Novo 5 is sure to impress even the most discerning vaper. One of the standout features of the Novo 5 is its super-compact size, making it easy to take with you wherever you go. Despite its small size, however, the device still manages to pack a punch, thanks to its powerful and long-lasting 900mAh built-in battery and variable power output of 5-30W . It even finds space for a discreet yet easy to read 0.69inch screen for all your settings. The Novo 5 is perfect for MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping, providing a crisp, satisfying draw that is ideal for those who are transitioning from smoking to vaping. Its rotating adjustable airflow system allows you to customize your draw to your preference, whether you prefer a tighter or looser draw. You can choose between using the fire button or auto inhale activation to start vaping, making it easy to use regardless of your preference. Variable Wattage lets you further tune your vaping experience on the Smok Novo 5. The Smok Novo 5 2ml pods are refillable and come with built-in mesh 0.7ohm mesh coils, providing exceptional flavour and vapor production. The coils are designed to last longer than traditional coils, reducing the need for frequent replacements. Refilling the pods is clean and simple, thanks to the side-fill port. These pods are suitable for use with 50/50 , Nic Salts , and high-PG e-liquids, making it easy to find your perfect juice. The Smok Novo 5 Pod Kit is a top-performing device that's perfect for both beginners and experienced vapers alike. With its compact size, powerful features, and customizable airflow system, the Novo 5 delivers a truly satisfying vaping experience. Please note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
